#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: accessibility-plugin-onetap-pro.php
msgid "OneTap Pro (for WordPress OneTap Pro - #1 Accessibility)"
msgstr "OneTap Pro (za WordPress OneTap Pro - #1 Pristupačnost)"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: accessibility-plugin-onetap-pro.php
msgid "https://wponetap.com"
msgstr "https://wponetap.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: accessibility-plugin-onetap-pro.php
msgid ""
"OneTap is a multilingual WordPress plugin designed for seamless website "
"accessibility. With a simple one-click installation, it ensures your site "
"meets accessibility standards without any hassle. Built for performance, "
"providing an inclusive, user-friendly web environment for all visitors."
msgstr ""
"OneTap je višejezični WordPress plugin dizajniran za besprijekornu "
"pristupačnost web stranice. Jednostavnom instalacijom jednim klikom "
"osigurava da vaša stranica zadovoljava standarde pristupačnosti bez ikakvih "
"problema. Izgrađen za performanse, pruža inkluzivno, korisnički prijateljsko "
"web okruženje za sve posjetitelje."

